        </Box>
        <Text style={{ marginTop: 14, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F2F7F8', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>入口已经受影响，跨区仍要逐跳命中规则</Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 12, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8 }}>
