            </Box>
            <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 4, paddingBottom: 4, border: '1px solid rgba(242,247,248,0.14)', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.60)' }}>10 MIN</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 4, paddingBottom: 4, border: '1px solid rgba(107,200,209,0.28)', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: '#6BC8D1' }}>TEACHING</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Text style={{ marginTop: 18, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: '#6BC8D1', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>LEARNING OBJECTIVES</Text>
        <Text style={{ marginTop: 7, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>· 区分 DMZ 内 MAIL 路径与跨区 Web → App 路径</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>· 验证跨区必须逐跳命中 Edge 与 Internal 规则</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>· 观察应用服务器之后的 FILE / DATABASE 服务</Text>

        <Text style={{ marginTop: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: '#6BC8D1', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>WATCH FOR</Text>
        <Text style={{ marginTop: 7, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>Web 入口是预设受影响节点；DMZ 内可到 Mail；跨区到 App 必须两台防火墙同时显式放行。</Text>

        <Text style={{ marginTop: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: '#E78172', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>TASK</Text>
        <Text style={{ marginTop: 7, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>限制受影响 Web 入口经应用服务影响数据库，同时保持两条必要业务可达。</Text>

